            For most people, the DJI Power 1000 V2 is the best DJI power station: 1kWh, 2,600W of output, very fast wall charging and a quick UPS switchover. Choose the Power 2000 and an expansion battery for home backup, the Power 500 for devices and drones, and the car combo if you charge on the road.
          </p>
